    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Well Presented 2 Bed Apartment With Stunning River Views\n\nThe sale of 19 Waterside, Rosbercon, New Ross presents a superb opportunity to acquire a well located 2 bedroom apartment in this popular riverside development. Extending to approximately 57 sq m, the apartment offers well-proportioned and easily managed accommodation comprising an entrance hall, open-plan kitchen/living area which enjoys uninterrupted views across the River Barrow towards New Ross, two bedrooms (main with en-suite shower room) and bathroom. The Waterside enjoys an excellent location overlooking the River Barrow and within easy walking distance of New Ross town centre and its many amenities. The property also offers convenient access to the South East Greenway and the wider road network. An ideal opportunity for an owner occupier or investor seeking a conveniently located property in the heart of New Ross. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallwith laminate flooring\n\nOpen Plan Living Space 5.7m x 3.7m with range of fitted units and doors to balcony \n\nBedroom 1. 4.7m x 2.8m plus en suite shower room (1.5m x 1.4m) and storage closet\n\nBedroom 2. 3.3m x 2.1m \n\nBathroom 2.4m x 1.4m\n\n\nServices:All mains services, electric heating and annual service charge applies \nBER:B3 No 102163755\nEircode: Y34 NX44\nViewing:By Prior Appointment\n\n"
